00:00:00,030 --> 00:00:01,750
Integration.

2
00:00:01,750 --> 00:00:05,960
Lessons in language learning. A.

3
00:00:05,960 --> 00:00:12,770
Kitty is doing some research on the famous language master Jiao Yuan Ren.

4
00:00:12,770 --> 00:00:15,980
Here is a brief introduction to him.

5
00:00:15,980 --> 00:00:20,675
Read it and answer the questions below.

6
00:00:20,675 --> 00:00:23,620
Jiao Yuan Ren.

7
00:00:23,620 --> 00:00:25,190
A language master.

8
00:00:25,190 --> 00:00:35,880
Jiao Yuan Ren could speak over 30 Chinese dialects and some foreign languages like English, French and German.

9
00:00:35,880 --> 00:00:40,040
He had great talent and strong interest in languages.

10
00:00:40,040 --> 00:00:43,840
He also found useful ways to learn languages.

11
00:00:43,840 --> 00:00:51,640
Jiao thought it was important to spend a lot of time reading, speaking and listening to the language.

12
00:00:51,640 --> 00:00:56,710
Every time he went to a new place, he would talk with the locals.

13
00:00:56,710 --> 00:01:02,450
He quickly learnt their language by putting himself in the language environment.

14
00:01:02,450 --> 00:01:09,760
Also, Jiao always carried a pen and paper with him to write down useful sentences.

15
00:01:09,760 --> 00:01:16,310
Jiao believed that it was better to focus on learning sentences than single words.

16
00:01:16,310 --> 00:01:21,120
In this way he remembered the meanings of the word swell.

17
00:01:21,120 --> 00:01:28,400
It is hard to learn a new language, but if we do it the right way, it will be a lot easier.
